A minor version with forward entries: translating forward is implicit for a
compatible change, so the entries are refused.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	a: string
}
-- ship/history/0.1.thema --
Schema: {
	a:  string
	b?: int
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v0_1: {
		b: 1
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	a:  string
	b?: int
}
-- out/error --
error[E0355]: history/0.1.thema is backward compatible with 0.0, so it has no ForwardLens
 --> history/0.1.thema:6:1
  |
6 | ForwardLens: {
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = note: an instance of a version is already an instance of its minor successor; translating forward is implicit
  = help: remove the ForwardLens, or make a breaking change
